WEBVTT

NOTE
Illustrated menu-path guide. Not an actual screen recording.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.375
Let's find your Facebook relationships through your own account export. Menu names may vary.

2
00:00:06.375 --> 00:00:10.167
In Facebook settings, open Accounts Center.

3
00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:15.458
Look for Your information and permissions, then the export or download option.

4
00:00:15.458 --> 00:00:22.833
Choose your Facebook profile and your device. Select friends or connections, and JSON if offered.

5
00:00:22.833 --> 00:00:30.542
Request your export, then download it when notified. Large archives may need a focused list extracted first.

6
00:00:30.542 --> 00:00:38.542
Import supported friend-list files in the Genie. Review names and profiles; private emails and phones are not promised.
